  dialogueNodes:
  - id: Start
    text: 'Isn''t it boring to just use the weapon? Now I will introduce you some
      special abilities. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 1
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 1
    text: 'Just like the dropped weapon, come close to it and press <sprite name="f">
      to pick it up. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 2
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 2
    text: 'In the real dungeon, ability is droped by enemies like an item. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 3
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 3
    text: 'Ability is divided into two categories: attacking and defense. And each
      ability has its own cool down time. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 4
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 4
    text: 'Let''s just try one attacking ability first. I''ll spawn a cluster bomb
      ability. press <sprite name="f"> to pick it up  '
    nextNodeIds:
    - null
